      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's nice that everyone can turn gestures off now, but I don't see the reason for stripping the old functionality of the Index control scheme completely. Just leave it as an unbound option in SteamVR control settings so that we can change it if we want to without messing with anyone who may prefer the new control scheme.\nI personally have gesture toggling on pressing down the trackpad on my left controller. This is a completely unused area of the controller with both the new and old control schemes yet I cannot have the toggling bound to the trackpad anymore. This is something I'd really like to see changed, makes it much more of a hassle on Index in its current state.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
